# Tinybones, Bauble Burglar: "exile it from their graveyard with a stash counter on it" (CR 701.13, 400.7). Bot2 discards its
# Lightning Bolt to Tinybones's ability, and with the trigger on the stack Bot1 sacrifices Tormod's Crypt to exile Bot2's
# graveyard: the Bolt is exiled by it with no counter and the trigger finds nothing to exile. Bot1 can't cast the Bolt from
# exile - it has no stash counter - though it can play the Mountain Bot2 discarded to its hand size on turn 2, which has.

